    verdict: "Ernie Bot is a serious product built for a market that is not India. Its Baidu search grounding makes it the best tool on this list for researching Chinese companies and topics, and the image generation is a genuine convenience. For everything else an Indian user does, the signup friction, weak Hindi, filtered answers and Chinese data residency mean ChatGPT or Gemini remain the sensible default.",
