    verdict: "Hunyuan is worth your attention for exactly one reason, which is 3D generation that has few real competitors at any price. Because the models are open-weight, an Indian studio can run them locally and avoid the data residency question altogether. As a general assistant it is irrelevant to Indian users, and the chat app is not meaningfully available here.",
